### 1) Login – få accessToken + refreshToken
POST http://localhost:4000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Kyle"
}

###

### 2) Hent posts (sæt accessToken ind efter "Bearer ")
GET http://localhost:3000/posts
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HER

###

### 3) Refresh – få nyt accessToken (når det gamle er udløbet)
POST http://localhost:4000/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HER"
}

###

### 4) Logout – slet refresh token
DELETE http://localhost:4000/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HER"
}
